{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/Intro_Steam.png?t=1748620154\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fly</strong>\u00a0around and\u00a0<strong>explore</strong> the island at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gather</strong> seeds to <strong>replant</strong> the forests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/TREE-PLANTING.gif?t=1748620154\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chat</strong> and <strong>make friends</strong> with the locals - they might help you with clues and directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hike</strong> up the hills and mountains to take in the view, and <strong>level up</strong>! Can you reach all the peaks?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/HILL-TOP.gif?t=1748620154\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There used to be ton of native flowers on the island. Are they all gone or just really well hidden?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t forget to <strong>catch</strong> some worms for dinner while you\u2019re out and about!\u00a0<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/WORMS.gif?t=1748620154\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575210?t=1748620154","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/9c45cf0782bed13ca7c9e7b6033e804a0bf53f5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748620154","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/b514cc74d2a92ca30dc333250d6ccacbb468e84c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748620154","ca